cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use blind-counsel or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "blind-counsel: confidential legal AI on an untrusted cloud without TEEs"
abstract: >-
  Research proof of concept. Keyed obfuscation of an open-weight LLM on an untrusted
  cloud fails. The operator recovered 100% of secret content. A blind-cloud design
  keeps client data on the device. Public law reasoning is precomputed in the cloud,
  fetched by private information retrieval, and applied on the laptop. 0 secrets
  reached the cloud. Final round verdict: FAIL, task routing 7 of 8.
